inputFields.description:
Unique identifier for the clocking group.
You can get this identifier for the clocking group assigned to a domain through:
query Domain($domainId: ID, $name: String) {
  domain(id: $domainId, name: $name) {
    clockingGroupId
    clockingGroup {
      id
    }
  }
}
